sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Analyst
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant V as Validation
    participant M as XGBoost model
    participant X as SHAP
    participant N as Next Best Action
    participant DB as Database
    A->>UI: Choose customers.csv
    UI->>API: POST /api/customers/upload
    API->>V: Check every row
    alt Any row invalid
        V-->>API: Errors (row + column)
        API-->>UI: 400, nothing saved
    else All rows valid
        API->>M: Score all customers
        M-->>API: Probability, then risk level
        API->>X: Explain each customer
        X-->>API: Contribution of every field
        API->>N: Find best retention action
        N->>M: Re-score changed copies
        N-->>API: Best action + plan
        API->>DB: Save customers + follow-ups
        API-->>UI: 250 inserted, 0 updated
    end
